 de APIs RESTful con Django REST Framework","Implementación de almacenamiento en caché y manejo de señales eficientes en proyectos Django"],"fr":["Construction d''applications web Django évolutives","Conception d''API RESTful avec Django REST Framework","Mise en œuvre d''une mise en cache et d''une gestion des signaux efficaces dans les projets Django"],"de":["Entwicklung skalierbarer Django-Webanwendungen","Entwicklung von RESTful APIs mit Django REST Framework","Implementierung effizienter Caching- und Signalbehandlung in Django-Projekten"],"pt":["Building scalable Django web applications","Designing RESTful APIs with Django REST Framework","Implementing efficient caching and signal handling in Django projects"],"ru":["Building scalable Django web applications","Designing RESTful APIs with Django REST Framework","Implementing efficient caching and signal handling in Django projects"],"ar":["Building scalable Django web applications","Designing RESTful APIs with Django REST Framework","Implementing efficient caching and signal handling in Django projects"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Django and Django REST Framework installation","Python knowledge necessary","Specific to Django framework"],"zh":["需要Django和Django REST Framework的安装","需要Python知识","特定于Django框架"],"ja":["DjangoおよびDjango REST Frameworkのインストールが必要","Pythonの知識が必要","Djangoフレームワークに特有"],"ko":["Django 및 Django REST Framework 설치가 필요","Python 지식이 필요","Django 프레임워크에 특정"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Django y Django REST Framework","Conocimiento de Python necesario","Específico del framework Django"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Django et Django REST Framework","Connaissance de Python nécessaire","Spécifique au framework Django"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von Django und Django REST Framework","Python-Kenntnisse erforderlich","Spezifisch für das Django-Framework"],"pt":["Requires Django and Django REST Framework installation","Python knowledge necessary","Specific to Django framework"],"ru":["